-- === ПЕРЕДВИЖЕНИЕ ДЛЯ СБОРА МОНЕТ (БЕЗОСТАНОВОЧНЫЙ ПОЛЕТ БЕЗ ЗАДЕРЖЕК) ===
local function moveToPositionPhysically(targetPosition, targetCoin, bv, bg)
    local char = rt:Character()
    if not char or not char.PrimaryPart then return false end

    local hrp = char.PrimaryPart
    local underfloorOffset = SETTINGS.UnderfloorOffset or 3.8
    local finalPosition = targetPosition - Vector3.new(0, underfloorOffset, 0)

    local startPos = hrp.Position
    local lookAtPos = Vector3.new(finalPosition.X, startPos.Y, finalPosition.Z)
    if (lookAtPos - startPos).Magnitude > 0.1 then
        bg.CFrame = CFrame.new(startPos, lookAtPos) * CFrame.Angles(math.rad(-90), 0, 0)
    end

    local coinRemoved = false
    local cRemoved = nil
    if targetCoin and targetCoin.Parent then
        cRemoved = targetCoin.ChildRemoved:Connect(function(child)
            if child:IsA("TouchTransmitter") or child.Name == "TouchInterest" then
                coinRemoved = true
            end
        end)
    end

    local flyStart = tick()

    while not IsTerminated and SETTINGS.AutoFarmEnabled and char and char.PrimaryPart and CurrentState == State.Action do
        if tick() - flyStart > 6 then break end
        local hum = char:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
        if hum and hum.Health <= 0 then break end

        if coinRemoved or rt.touchedCoins[targetCoin] == "collected" then
            if cRemoved then cRemoved:Disconnect() end
            rt.touchedCoins[targetCoin] = "collected"
            rt.cachedCoins[targetCoin] = nil
            return true
        end

        local currentPos = hrp.Position
        local distance = (finalPosition - currentPos).Magnitude

        if distance < 2.0 then
            local touchFn = firetouchtransmitter or firetouchinterest or (syn and syn.firetouchinterest)
            local touchPart = char:FindFirstChild("Head") or hrp

            if touchFn and targetCoin and targetCoin.Parent then
                pcall(function()
                    touchFn(touchPart, targetCoin, 0)
                    touchFn(touchPart, targetCoin, 1)
                    if touchPart ~= hrp then
                        touchFn(hrp, targetCoin, 0)
                        touchFn(hrp, targetCoin, 1)
                    end
                end)
            end

            local waitStart = os.clock()
            while not coinRemoved and rt.touchedCoins[targetCoin] ~= "collected" and (os.clock() - waitStart < 0.25) and not IsTerminated and SETTINGS.AutoFarmEnabled do
                RunService.Heartbeat:Wait()
            end

            if cRemoved then cRemoved:Disconnect() end
            rt.touchedCoins[targetCoin] = "collected"
            rt.cachedCoins[targetCoin] = nil
            return true
        end

        local direction = (finalPosition - currentPos).Unit
        bv.Velocity = direction * SETTINGS.Speed

        RunService.Heartbeat:Wait()
    end

    if cRemoved then cRemoved:Disconnect() end
    return false
end

-- === ЛОГИКА СБОРА МОНЕТ ===
local function CollectCoins()
    Working = true
    CurrentRoundCoins = 0
    BagIsFull = false

    task.wait(0.3)
    if not SETTINGS.AutoFarmEnabled or IsTerminated or not RoundInProgress() or not rt:CheckIfPlayerWasInARound() then
        return
    end

    local map = rt:Map()
    if map then
        if not rt.coinContainer then
            rt.coinContainer = map:FindFirstChild("CoinContainer")
        end
        if rt.coinContainer then
            PopulateCoins()
        end
    end

    local char = rt:Character()
    local hrp = char and (char.PrimaryPart or (char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")))
    local hum = char and char:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")

    if not char or not hrp then return end
    if not char.PrimaryPart then
        pcall(function() char.PrimaryPart = hrp end)
    end
    
    updateBodyPartsCache() 
    
    if hum then hum.PlatformStand = true end

    local bv = hrp:FindFirstChild("FarmVelocity") or Instance.new("BodyVelocity")
    bv.Name = "FarmVelocity"
    bv.MaxForce = Vector3.new(9e9, 9e9, 9e9)
    bv.Velocity = Vector3.zero
    bv.Parent = hrp

    local bg = hrp:FindFirstChild("FarmGyro") or Instance.new("BodyGyro")
    bg.Name = "FarmGyro"
    bg.MaxTorque = Vector3.new(9e9, 9e9, 9e9)
    bg.P = 3000
    bg.Parent = hrp

    local alreadyHasCoins = (GetNearestCoin() ~= nil)
    if not alreadyHasCoins then
        local safeY = SETTINGS.SafeUnderfloorY or -120
        local safePos = Vector3.new(hrp.Position.X, safeY, hrp.Position.Z)
        hrp.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
        hrp.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
        char:PivotTo(CFrame.new(safePos))
        bv.Velocity = Vector3.zero
        UpdateStatus("Фарм: Сейф-зона (ожидание монет)", Color3.fromRGB(130, 200, 255))
    end

    local isFirstCoin = true

    while not IsTerminated and CurrentState == State.Action and SETTINGS.AutoFarmEnabled and not BagIsFull and rt:CheckIfPlayerWasInARound() do
        char = rt:Character()
        if not char or not char.PrimaryPart then break end
        hrp = char.PrimaryPart

        local targetCoin = GetNearestCoin()

        if targetCoin then
            if isFirstCoin then
                isFirstCoin = false
                UpdateStatus("Фарм: ТП (8 студов от первой монеты)", Color3.fromRGB(120, 255, 120))

                local underfloorOffset = SETTINGS.UnderfloorOffset or 3.8
                local targetPos = targetCoin.Position - Vector3.new(0, underfloorOffset, 0)

                local currentPos = hrp.Position
                local diff = currentPos - targetPos
                local diffXZ = Vector3.new(diff.X, 0, diff.Z)
                local dirXZ = (diffXZ.Magnitude > 0.1) and diffXZ.Unit or Vector3.new(0, 0, 1)
                local tpPos = targetPos + (dirXZ * 8)

                local lookAtPos = Vector3.new(targetPos.X, tpPos.Y, targetPos.Z)
                local tpCFrame = CFrame.new(tpPos, lookAtPos) * CFrame.Angles(math.rad(-90), 0, 0)

                for _, part in ipairs(rt.cachedBodyParts) do
                    if part and part.Parent then
                        part.CanCollide = false
                    end
                end

                hrp.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
                hrp.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
                char:PivotTo(tpCFrame)
                bg.CFrame = tpCFrame
                bv.Velocity = Vector3.zero
                RunService.Heartbeat:Wait()
            end

            UpdateStatus("Фарм: Лечу к монете", Color3.fromRGB(150, 255, 150))

            markCoinAsPending(targetCoin)

            local pickedUp = moveToPositionPhysically(targetCoin.Position, targetCoin, bv, bg)
            if not SETTINGS.AutoFarmEnabled or IsTerminated then break end

            if pickedUp and rt.touchedCoins[targetCoin] == "pending" then
                rt.touchedCoins[targetCoin] = "collected"

                if IsBagFull() then
                    break
                end
            end
        else
            if not rt.coinContainer then
                local currentMap = rt:Map()
                if currentMap then
                    local foundCc = currentMap:FindFirstChild("CoinContainer")
                    if foundCc then
                        rt.coinContainer = foundCc
                        PopulateCoins()
                    end
                end
            elseif next(rt.cachedCoins) == nil then
                PopulateCoins()
            end
            UpdateStatus("Фарм: Сейф-зона (ожидание появления монет)...", Color3.fromRGB(130, 200, 255))
            bv.Velocity = Vector3.zero
            task.wait(0.1)
        end
    end

    if bv and bv.Parent then bv:Destroy() end
    if bg and bg.Parent then bg:Destroy() end
    if hrp then
        hrp.AssemblyLinearVelocity = Vector3.zero
        hrp.AssemblyAngularVelocity = Vector3.zero
    end
    if hum then hum.PlatformStand = false end

    AutoFarmCleanUp()
end

